== Trivia ==
*'''Fisherman Gerald''' is married to {{NPCSprite|Fisherwoman Enid}}, their children are {{NPCSprite|Gwynnie}} and {{NPCSprite|Gavin}}.
*'''Fisherman Gerald'''{{'}}s dialogue mentions a distant pirate cove, which refers to a [[Fishing]] island that was once planned but has since been scrapped. <!-- confirmed by an admin, was told i could put this on here -->

